{"id":"1f29a86741dce65f","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-type.md","title":"有限量词秩 FO 类型","display":"df-fo-type — 有限量词秩 FO 类型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-type","aliases":["29-df-fo-type"],"display":"df-fo-type — 有限量词秩 FO 类型","depends_on":["[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-variable]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 6.9 and Exercise 6.11, pp.94–96, DjVu scans 109–111","source_basis":"原书有界秩等价接口已核对；类型集合及显式全赋值见证为本地形式化，不宣称含函数词汇上类型有限"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-type — 有限量词秩 FO 类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 6.9 and Exercise 6.11, pp.94–96, DjVu scans 109–111"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书有界秩等价接口已核对；类型集合及显式全赋值见证为本地形式化，不宣称含函数词汇上类型有限"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_m)\\in|A|^m\">\\(\\bar a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_m)\\in|A|^m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 为互异变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span> 和满足关系见所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时元组为空，变量约束和长度零的合取取空真。类型是关于给定变量列表的元语言公式集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tp}^{\\mathsf{FO}}_{k,m}(A,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\ \\middle|\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\}\\land\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq k\\land\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\left(\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{m}\\beta(x_i)=a_i\\land A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tp}^{\\mathsf{FO}}_{k,m}(A,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\ \\middle|\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\}\\land\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq k\\land\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\left(\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{m}\\beta(x_i)=a_i\\land A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.9 及 Exercise 6.11，印刷页94–96、扫描页109–111，讨论有限变量和有界秩公式的等价。本条把满足的有界秩公式收成一个类型集合，并非原书另一个编号定义。全赋值见证将此前未声明的多变量局部赋值记号展开；非空域保证给定有限元组赋值总可扩充，满足关系对公式结构的归纳保证真值只依赖自由变量的值，因此类型与扩充值无关。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时恢复有界秩句子理论。原书有限类型引理要求有限关系词汇；此处作为类型的集合定义本身允许函数，不断言其可能取值数有限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_m)\\in|A|^m","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tp}^{\\mathsf{FO}}_{k,m}(A,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\ \\middle|\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\}\\land\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq k\\land\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\left(\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{m}\\beta(x_i)=a_i\\land A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"m=0","display":false}],"bytes":2101,"backlinks":[{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-type]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-fo-type]]"}],"outgoing":["a3fa1d78e657e6a2","db2b32546860e623","5a04c13fd73e2c1c","4de8e0c8085801f5","3ee556c64b16809b","28e86a5f0243a0ae","ac5c4072279f0088","ad08b66c5e54a436"]}